      "reason": "Writes the session context file at tmp_path / 'pact-session-context.json' and patches the plugin's context module to read it. Its flagged sites (276-277) mkdir tasks/{team} and teams/{team} under get_claude_config_dir(); the autouse _isolate_config_root_to_tmp fixture, pinned by the conftest isolation contract, redirects that root to tmp_path for every test, and team_name passes the plugin's safe-component check first. It reads nothing in the checkout.",
      "extra_reads": []
    },
    "tests/fixtures/pin_growth/generators.py": {
      "sha256": "9b6a745c62dfe7c3f59888e096f3e1b5e41545807f5f1174de117df9b86e3e7a",
      "reason": "Every flagged site assigns an attribute of a _Pin object this module builds in memory (k, comment, title, body, snip, tail_stray) from random choices over literal text. Its imports are copy, hashlib, random, re, typing and the in-memory fence oracle; nothing is patched into another module and no file is read.",
      "extra_reads": []
    },
